    {
      "order": 5,
      "kind": "rich_text",
      "source_html": "<p></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color: black;background-color: white;font-size: 10.5pt;font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>PETITE SIZE GUIDE INFORMATION</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"></p>",
      "parsed_blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "PETITE SIZE GUIDE INFORMATION"
        }
      ],
      "target_composer_eligible": true
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "kind": "rich_text",
      "source_html": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(33, 33, 33); color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; margin: 0cm 0px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 14px;\">Our petite range is designed for women between 4ft 11” (149.86cm) and 5ft 3” (160cm).</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(33, 33, 33); color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; margin: 0cm 0px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(33, 33, 33); color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; margin: 0cm 0px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 14px;\">The sizing is the same as our main range, with proportions carefully adjusted to suit a petite frame.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(33, 33, 33); color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; margin: 0cm 0px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(33, 33, 33); color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; margin: 0cm 0px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 14px;\">Here’s how our petite fit differs from the regular fit:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(33, 33, 33); color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; margin: 0cm 0px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span><br></span></p><ul style=\"caret-color: rgb(33, 33, 33); color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Aptos; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; margin-bottom: 0cm; font-size: 16px;\"><li style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; color: black; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shoulder width: reduced by 1cm</span></li><li style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; color: black; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Bodice length (side neck to waist): reduced by 2cm</span></li><li style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; color: black; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Front and back rise length: reduced by 1.5cm</span></li><li style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; color: black; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Sleeve length: reduced by 1–4cm (style dependent)</span></li><li style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; color: black; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shorts leg length: reduced by 1–2cm</span></li><li style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; color: black; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Trousers leg length: reduced by 5–7cm (style dependent)</span></li><li style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; color: black; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Tops length: reduced by 3–7cm (style dependent)</span></li><li style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; color: black; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mini dresses: reduced by 5cm</span></li><li style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; color: black; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Midi to maxi dresses: reduced&nbsp;by 8–10cm (style dependent)</span></li><li style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; color: black; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mini skirts: reduced by 3cm</span></li><li style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; color: black; margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Midi to maxi skirts: reduced by 5–8cm</span></li></ul>",
      "parsed_blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Our petite range is designed for women between 4ft 11” (149.86cm) and 5ft 3” (160cm)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "The sizing is the same as our main range, with proportions carefully adjusted to suit a petite frame."
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Here’s how our petite fit differs from the regular fit:"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Shoulder width: reduced by 1cm"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Bodice length (side neck to waist): reduced by 2cm"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Front and back rise length: reduced by 1.5cm"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Sleeve length: reduced by 1–4cm (style dependent)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Shorts leg length: reduced by 1–2cm"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Trousers leg length: reduced by 5–7cm (style dependent)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Tops length: reduced by 3–7cm (style dependent)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Mini dresses: reduced by 5cm"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Midi to maxi dresses: reduced by 8–10cm (style dependent)"
        },
